### offer.list — ofertas geradas/validadas pela matriz
POST https://alteapay.com/api/webhooks/n8n
Content-Type: application/json
x-alteapay-signature: <HMAC_HEX>
x-alteapay-timestamp: <EPOCH_SEGUNDOS>

{ "action": "offer.list", "session_id": "<UUID_SESSAO>" }

### Resposta esperada
# 200 { "success": true, "offers": [ { "id": "<UUID_OFERTA>", "terms": { ... }, "valid_until": "..." } ] }
